# /etc/mem-mcp/plugins.list — one repo URL per line
#
# Format:
#   - One git URL per line (HTTPS or SSH, depending on deploy host auth config)
#   - Lines starting with # are comments
#   - Blank lines are ignored
#
# The install_plugins.sh script will:
#   1. Clone or pull each repo into /opt/mem-mcp-plugins/<repo-name>/
#   2. Run `pip install -e` to install as an editable package into memsys's venv
#   3. Load the plugin's entry point from mem_mcp.skills on next memsys startup
#
# Examples (uncomment to enable):
#
# git@github.com:dheemanopc/mem-mcp-skill-kite.git
# git@github.com:dheemanopc/mem-mcp-skill-reminders.git
#
# For private repos, ensure the deploy host has git SSH auth configured
# (e.g., via EC2 instance profile + CodeCommit, or SSH deploy key in ~/.ssh/config).
